<title>MEXICO: Mexico's March manufacturing employment up 5.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's March manufacturing employment up 5.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Employment in Mexico's manufacturing sector rose by 5.6 percent in March compared to March 1996, the National Statistics Institute (INEGI) said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The increase follows a rise of 4.5 percent in February, INEGI said.</p>
<p>Hours worked in the sector increased by 2.7 percent in the first quarter compared with the same period a year ago, it said.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
